It's <style=\"highlight\">Grove Academy and Solise</style>.","female":"Sure. It's <style=\"highlight\">Grove Academy and Solise</style>.","variant_male_record_index":"219513","variant_female_record_index":"219514","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1620961004":{"text":"Sure. It's <style=\"highlight\">Grove Academy and Solise</style>.","source_cn":"是呀。答案就是——<style=highlight>空境森林，林间课堂的娑丽丝</style>。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF0E2DDF57E258B18","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Sure. It's <style=\"highlight\">Grove Academy and Solise</style>.","female":"Sure. It's <style=\"highlight\">Grove Academy and Solise</style>.","variant_male_record_index":"219513","variant_female_record_index":"219514","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620961005:2":{"text":"A place bathed in sunshine and filled with blooming flowers. That's Grove Academy. Someone who can ease pain and offer comfort. That's the healer, Solise.","source_cn":"阳光灿烂、花朵盛开的地方，就是林间课堂；为人们带走伤痛...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x99DA4AF343DCB16F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"A place bathed in sunshine and filled with blooming flowers. That's Grove Academy. Someone who can ease pain and offer comfort. That's the healer, Solise.","female":"A place bathed in sunshine and filled with blooming flowers. That's Grove Academy. Someone who can ease pain and offer comfort. That's the healer, Solise.","variant_male_record_index":"219515","variant_female_record_index":"219516","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620961006:1":{"text":"That's it!","source_cn":"没错，答案应该就是这个！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE9E271A2CCA96C34","variant_